sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Clin as Clinician/Admin
    participant Bill as BillingService
    participant Num as BillingNumbering
    participant Pay as Payments
    participant DB as Postgres
    participant Audit as AuditService

    Clin->>Bill: Generate billable items from encounter/orders
    Bill->>DB: Collect BillableItem charges
    Bill->>Num: Allocate invoice number (INV-YYYY-NNNNNN)
    Bill->>DB: Create Invoice + InvoiceItems
    Bill->>Audit: audit invoice.created
    Bill-->>Clin: Invoice issued
    participant Patient as Patient/Insurer
    Patient->>Pay: Make payment
    Pay->>Num: Allocate receipt number (RCT-YYYY-NNNNNN)
    Pay->>DB: Create Payment linked to Invoice
    Pay->>DB: Update Invoice status (PARTIALLY_PAID/PAID)
    Pay->>Audit: audit payment.received
    opt Insurance
        Bill->>Bill: Create InsuranceClaim (CLM-YYYY-NNNNNN)
        Bill->>DB: Create InsuranceClaim linked to Invoice
        Bill->>Audit: audit insurance_claim.created
    end
    Note over Pay: Payments update balances; finance journal entries follow business rules
    Note over DB: finance_transactions_balance_guard enforces balanced journals
